OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after car hits
OL,4,Apedestrians at bus stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died after a car crashed
OL,7,Finto a bus stop and hit two
OL,8,Fpedestrians.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police said a black
OL,11,FVauxhall Insignia had been travelling
OL,12,Falong Willow Brook Road in Corby and
OL,13,Fhad "appeared to be turning left into
OL,14,FFotheringhay Road when it left its
OL,15,Fintended path" at about 07:30 BST.
OL,17,FA female pedestrian in her 30s died at
OL,18,Fthe scene and a second pedestrian, a
OL,19,Fteenage boy, had minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
